# Plan: Revert to Emission Style Inputs

## Goal
Replace the "Premium Floating Label" inputs with the standard, proven style from [emissions-calculator.html](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/public/emissions-calculator.html) as requested by the user.

## Proposed Changes

### 1. Styles (manage-data.html)
- [DELETE] `.input-group-premium`, `.mole-input-premium`, `.floating-label`.
- [NEW/UPDATE] Enforce `.mole-input` style:
    ```css
    .mole-input {
        background: var(--bg-card) !important;
        border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        padding: 10px 12px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        /* ... focus states ... */
    }
    ```
- [UPDATE] Label styling to `display: block; margin-bottom: 8px; font-weight: 500;`.

### 2. Markup (manage-data.html)
- [MODIFY] Revert HTML structure:
    - From:
        ```html
        <div class="input-group-premium">
            <input ...>
            <label class="floating-label">...</label>
        </div>
        ```
    - To:
        ```html
        <div class="input-group">
            <label>Title case label</label>
            <input class="mole-input" placeholder="e.g. Value">
        </div>
        ```
- [MODIFY] Apply to both "Custom Factors" and "Facilities" forms.

## Verification
- Visually match [emissions-calculator.html](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/public/emissions-calculator.html).
- Verify inputs have solid background (no transparency).
